hooks.prompt:
Check if all files in docs/guides/ were followed. Context: $ARGUMENTS

1. Read transcript_path (JSONL) and collect all Write/Edit files from the conversation
2. If no src/ files were changed → {"ok": true}
3. Read all files in docs/guides/
4. For each changed src/ file, check it against applicable guide rules

Respond JSON: {"ok": true} or {"ok": false, "reason": "violations: ..."}
